<title>UK: Copper/aluminium flip up, end LME firmer.</title>
<headline>Copper/aluminium flip up, end LME firmer.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Rallies on kerb and ends at day's high, although still rangebound. Cash/threes widens slightly to $65 backwardation. ALUMINIUM - Roars higher on the kerb, as stops hit above $1,640. Contango also narrows. NICKEL - Firm close after late kerb bounce. ZINC - Picks up late, ends firmer. LEAD - Steady.</p>
</text>
